# Docker build context exclusions — critically, .env files. The Dockerfiles COPY
# whole app directories (apps/backend/, apps/web/); without this, a local .env with
# real secrets would get baked permanently into an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.git
